WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:05.200
Beneath the Earth's surface, pressure builds long before the world feels it.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.880
The signals are there. But recognizing them requires knowing where to look.

3
00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:20.060
Financial markets have fault lines of their own. Hidden pressures. Interconnected risks. Signals beneath the surface.

4
00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:28.260
FAULTLINE was built to connect those signals, examine the evidence, and reveal the forces shaping what comes next.

5
00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:33.080
Because understanding the pressure changes how you prepare.

